      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, i'm working on some nursing training materials for a clinical rotation module. can u help me write a detailed patient case study for a student to practice pain assessment? \n\nmake it a middle aged man, let's call him Jack Miller, who comes in with an acute injury. include his vitals, his description of the pain, and his demeanor so students can practice gauging how much medication he might need.",
